# Store text files as LF and check them out as LF on every platform.
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows
# default) writes CRLF into the working tree and `pnpm lint` (biome check)
# reports a formatting error on every file: 216 errors on a clean checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets that must never be converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
